      "title": "Maya's First Day at a New School",
      "body": [
        "Maya's family moved to a new town last month. Today is her first day at the new school. In the morning, Maya feels nervous. Her stomach feels strange, and she holds her mother's hand tightly.",
        "At school, the teacher, Mrs. Ani, introduces Maya to the class. A kind girl named Lala sits next to her. 'Don't worry,' Lala whispers. 'Our class is fun.'",
        "At break time, Maya and Lala eat snacks together and talk about their favorite cartoons. When the bell rings at two o'clock, Maya goes home with a big smile. Her first day was not scary at all."
      ],
